# SHRD—Double Precision Shift -- override
# The manual's Operation shifts bit by bit in a loop over the count
# ("FOR i := ... DO DEST[i] := ..."); v1's double shifter does it in one
# step (DoubleShift): the count masked to 5 bits (6 with REX.W), CF the last
# bit shifted out of DEST, OF set for 1-bit shifts when the sign changes,
# SF/ZF/PF of the result, nothing changed for a zero count (Flags Affected).
@operation
DEST := DoubleShift(SHRD, DEST, SRC, COUNT);
